{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_cae83b625e1e","title":"小众软件","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704710&idx=1&sn=e2a7f2e84742abce49fc1bf1af9c1a30&chksm=bc3f26a7436113b22e2cdba628b9515d0f9e93dd6e3999f5e736b01d05441bd74f40f3a4d4f2&scene=126&sessionid=1795180885#rd","description":"推荐有灵魂的电脑软件、手机应用。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"小众软件","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM5oB1jblgiarD8aOiaYBeEPnOE9DyicmmBJXIdUHFNC0h8MA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-20T09:46:52.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MjM5NDMwMTI2MA%3D%3D:2651704710:1","title":"在苹果手机中装安卓系统｜ 已被苹果下架，但开源了！","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704710&idx=1&sn=e2a7f2e84742abce49fc1bf1af9c1a30&chksm=bc3f26a7436113b22e2cdba628b9515d0f9e93dd6e3999f5e736b01d05441bd74f40f3a4d4f2&scene=126&sessionid=1795180885#rd","description":"终于，在苹果中安装安卓，已经照进现实了。笑死我了这个叫 Andarium 的 iPhone 应用，可以在 iPhone 中跑一个安卓虚拟机，实现奇葩的苹果装安卓效果。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxdYiakDBS6wRtpY8fiaazCpRicKLNjT12WxVMl74GUiaG92IHxPWAVQFItkpkLDb33ibFM3z9VyCElhDKAAuUEpBzWRCNNfmDPKalhk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T09:46:52.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5NDMwMTI2MA%3D%3D:2651704710:2","title":"群晖 NAS 再曝两个严重漏洞：最高 9.8 分，可远程读写文件，官方紧急修复中","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704710&idx=2&sn=e4ac9e201d81c2d8cda2ae6890f4b3eb&chksm=bc5e7cf51ba09856d64d319e9067f1faafd9a26e9ae20965dbaecbfa090729ac4f9819ad08cf&scene=126&sessionid=1795180885#rd","description":"群晖 NAS 用户注意，又有两个安全漏洞需要处理了。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxdDptW03LiboxiaTFPfQs4CxqIibJyHZeV9iaCzJWMDoYPuwesicCsfSmO30Zzv7h