\n系统设置显示这是 Android 17，来自 LineageOS 24 版本。\n\n也不是不能用，不装微信了，怕封号😂\n\n你们还想看啥，留言给我","content":"<p>这个叫 Andarium 的 iPhone 应用，可以在 iPhone 中跑一个安卓虚拟机，实现奇葩的苹果装安卓效果。<br /><br />就很离谱。不过苹果已经下架该应用。<br /><br />有幸，我手机里还有这个 app 😂<br /><br />因为是虚拟机，整体体验有点卡，触摸感受也不是很顺畅，但是能用。<br /><br />我甚至安装了 Firefox 打开网页（自带没有浏览器）。<br /><br />系统设置显示这是 Android 17，来自 LineageOS 24 版本。<br /><br />也不是不能用，不装微信了，怕封号😂<br /><br />你们还想看啥，留言给我</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxcdVLepGSJL00vWIuzqakicQNL7ZyLwPdFvwQUUEVI1DhZ2giaibNUfN8viboH7bWbvPAa6UIIEMBvPlc4GhvBU3ibgfAAqoXCH6ibhg%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxfcNAkMlpOHycBwwiccUgpx2l68odslSibap1ZQJbwpPSakeSdH35L7tsMzN2JzmwfLuv6BpFSucWM0LImXGYyB6FVDqr8oexqAg%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxcg8OokMVTcD48MD7ulE1FicwBzV5F2w6u3nicic6C6cA1vc4x9lsD6iaMjIrhxxlljG4kKAkfn3j1EwgB8pV1Ms4XtfV0ocz06CFQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxfeJwDQwGubcuZFJczU1hBPVWUE4KQ53JLv7TeibiaMK5zVOoiaOEPTsHdV92ibG8tlpE3Bw4LticSCWuaeb4HoibgewJkqbkiccy4yhg%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxevfWDz71ibT4qFeNHaKuIxTqFNhUXgIiaUHAEiaRia6RN8C4xYBFj4dP8iaRbHMWeQk30ibjiczU3I2BZ7D0uAAarWJqcJBAMvFY3rFU%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxekXnmmWwpye20O3xkRdPRDLgnia7M72YJtFzLXnhUKRGyeyK66xL0jFFEnfiaMBIGspENVdf2y85duJ2g45LCRbQXaiaXErzt6lo%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?ur