635:1","title":"群晖再爆两项严重漏洞：无需登录可访问文件","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704635&idx=1&sn=81f635f500097ca81ae2b0e87d06299e&chksm=bc16263b27bd77b47debfeddbbb07200440513cea4ae448b0285b64b1b3f2314c3ab67ff9d39&scene=126&sessionid=1795180885#rd","description":"2026 年 11 月 19 日，群晖（Synology）连续发布两份安全公告 Synology-SA-26:21（<a class=\"wx_img_refer_link\" data-seq=\"4\" data-refer=\"图4\" style=\"\">图4</a>），涉及 DSM 与 BeeStation OS 的 OAuth API 和 NGINX HTTP/2（<a class=\"wx_img_refer_link\" data-seq=\"5\" data-refer=\"图5\" style=\"\">图5</a>）\n\n其中 OAuth API 漏洞的 CVSS 评分高达 9.8 分（满分 10 分），攻击者无需登录，就可能远程读取、修改 NAS 文件，或导致服务不可用。另一个则是昨天的 Nginx 漏洞，可能让 Web 服务崩溃，并在特定条件下远程执行代码。\n\n目前可以先关闭 OAuth 套件（<a class=\"wx_img_refer_link\" data-seq=\"3\" data-refer=\"图3\" style=\"\">图3</a>），以及快把公网访问都关了吧，就这样吧。","content":"<p>2026 年 11 月 19 日，群晖（Synology）连续发布两份安全公告 Synology-SA-26:21（&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;4&quot; data-refer=&quot;图4&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图4&lt;/a&gt;），涉及 DSM 与 BeeStation OS 的 OAuth API 和 NGINX HTTP/2（&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;5&quot; data-refer=&quot;图5&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图5&lt;/a&gt;）<br /><br />其中 OAuth API 漏洞的 CVSS 评分高达 9.8 分（满分 10 分），攻击者无需登录，就可能远程读取、修改 NAS 文件，或导致服务不可用。另一个则是昨天的 Nginx 漏洞，可能让 Web 服务崩溃，并在特定条件下远程执行代码。<br /><br />目前可以先关闭 OAuth 套件（&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;3&quot; data-refer=&quot;图3&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图3&lt;/a&gt;），以及快把公网访问都关了吧，就这样吧。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdUMGMlYavCCicNxBCqa4jJZa1oiaH2sqc9qWafbwudpond5bA0zibdibJiaLbcibJQwd8339N8JCMzaH8qE7mIUfoV9N4uu5CHcqL1o%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxe4F16I4OP4u83XNq4CgJFyQbJg05xHe2Suwv9DfOLO1lm9onnU7uHWVZYiaSHegcFlpeibGvuOUbVG02OHK0QNDEQl5pVn3Rycg%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxeaMfbrPe4H39EBX2jKjWicPXHH6ZXC8zzMAv5wnhKaaKdxvBxwIGpv0doZthIWHM3DXlibyicNvDicBiclHjxHjlpNzLyibZrDBYaJA%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxftmcLAxKoJxrC3fuclGtmdU3xiabXxsKTTw2licggIB6R0WOrEUrMmzUMaXNtuXOJ8UmbXtvOspgJ3XYBPM8OhLmzIVEYSHickuw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxf2uOOpRGfJ0iaAq7XzGtKevHMN3Lb78sAQMX6c89QRF3TSZbuS7rbXalxE1SuXeuQA9QR9eq5yLiaqUCIk5OVQz2xusz3PKmn4U%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxfBh5YZ3t44uNcr22H0m5xZcxxpN9YmZauRtpKTj6gXibw1gx4fsa4agh1Ejicqo4XqZfF1Edpicfes80IDX1V7669mGAqNtFNl9E%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdUMGMlYavCCicNxBCqa4jJZa1oiaH2sqc9qWafbwudpond5bA0zibdibJiaLbcibJQwd8339N8JCMzaH8qE7mIUfoV9N4uu5CHcqL1o%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxe4F16I4OP4u83XNq4CgJFyQbJg05xHe2Suwv9DfOLO1lm9onnU7uHWVZYiaSHegcFlpeibGvuOUbVG02OHK0QNDEQl5pVn3Rycg%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxeaMfbrPe4H39EBX2jKjWicPXHH6ZXC8zzMAv5wnhKaaKdxvBxwIGpv0doZthIWHM3DXlibyicNvDicBiclHjxHjlpNzLyibZrDBYaJA%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxftmcLAxKoJxrC3fuclGtmdU3xiabXxsKTTw2licggIB6R0WOrEUrMmzUMaXNtuXOJ8UmbXtvOspgJ3XYBPM8OhLmzIVEYSHickuw%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxf2uOOpRGfJ0iaAq7XzGtKevHMN3Lb78sAQMX6c89QRF3TSZ